{"id":354085,"title":"结课测试题｜这些关于复盘的知识你都掌握了吗？","content":"<p>你好，我是张鹏。</p><p>到这里，《跟着高手学复盘》这门课程的学习基本上就结束了。我特意给你准备了一个结课小测试，来帮助你检验自己的学习效果。</p><p>这套测试题共有 20 道题目，其中13道单选题，7道多选题，满分 100 分，系统自动评分。</p><p>还等什么，点击下面按钮开始测试吧！</p><p><a href=\"http://time.geekbang.org/quiz/intro?act_id=378&exam_id=1125\"><img src=\"./images/354085_1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>另外，我为你准备了一个<a href=\"https://jinshuju.net/f/fAKgE0\">调查问卷</a>，题目不多，主要还是希望听一下你对这门课的建议（比如你需不需要后续再做一些加餐，如果需要，你希望是什么话题），或者你还希望学什么课程。期待能听到你的反馈。</p><p><a href=\"https://jinshuju.net/f/fAKgE0\"><img src=\"./images/354085_2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":360954,"user_name":"ifelse","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2550743,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"D0565908C99695","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/26/eb/d7/90391376.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1667032560,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":133533,"content":"👍，一直学习打卡，手工给你点赞","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":2382705,"ctime":1673853916,"ip_address":"湖北","comment_id":360954,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":3,"score":2,"product_id":100070901,"comment_content":"70分","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2382705,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/24/5b/71/6b26cd51.jpg","nickname":"张鹏","note":"","ucode":"9B4EA6A9399434","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":599866,"discussion_content":"👍，一直学习打卡，手工给你点赞","content_length":15,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1673853916,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"湖北","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}